%% HTTP API 请求流程

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User as 用户/客户端
  participant SDK as @opencode-ai/sdk
  participant Server as HTTP Server<br/>opencode/server
  participant Instance as Instance Bootstrap
  participant Handler as Route Handler<br/>@opencode-ai/server
  participant V1 as V1 Session API
  participant V2 as SessionV2
  participant Events as Event SSE

  User->>SDK: 打开项目 / 发 prompt
  SDK->>Server: HTTP + x-opencode-directory header

  Note over Server,Instance: 实例解析
  Server->>Instance: resolve directory → InstanceContext
  Instance->>Instance: bootstrap(config, plugins, LSP, VCS)

  alt TUI 默认路径 (V1)
    SDK->>Handler: session message API
    Handler->>V1: SessionPrompt.prompt()
    V1->>V1: runLoop → Processor → LLM
  else Server/Public API (V2)
    SDK->>Handler: POST session.prompt
    Handler->>V2: SessionV2.prompt()
    V2->>V2: admit + wake
  end

  SDK->>Events: subscribe events/messages
  Events-->>SDK: SSE 流式更新
  SDK-->>User: UI 渲染

  Note over Server: 默认端口 4096<br/>OpenAPI from PublicApi<br/>mDNS 可选发现
